# (build 161) The rumble falling through a hole: Crevice's ground floor
# ($16), a level-5 Rolf walked down from cell 50,6 onto the crevice
# (blocks $50-$62, loc_6FCA's fall to Crevice B1 and SXFID_FellInHole,
# asked at tick 54). The sound driver starts it at the next tick's start:
# the shake follows it from there -- the big motor 70%, the small its
# first 6 ticks -- as long as its track plays (55-138), and is still at
# 139 (src/game/rumble.c).

start level $16 50 6
party 1 5
rumble-log motors.txt 3      # the motors at HIGH, change by change
wait idle
walk down 3                  # 54: onto the crevice, the screen fading
expect rumble hole 0         # the fall's sound asked, not yet started
wait ticks 1                 # 55: started
expect rumble hole 1
expect rumble going
wait ticks 83                # 138: its last tick
expect rumble going
wait ticks 1                 # 139: over, and no tail left above nothing
expect rumble still
wait idle
expect level $15             # Crevice B1
